  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "ww_c",
      "defType": "meta/comment",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": -294
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "Variable-font weight wave\n\nSeven rows of the same word in Roboto Flex (bundled, OFL). style/font-variations sets each row’s weight (wght) and width (wdth) from sin(time − row · 0.55), so a wave of weight rolls down the stack. The engine shapes every row at its axis values, so letters reflow as they swell.",
        "width": 460,
        "height": 230
      },
      "portValues": {
        "text": "Variable-font weight wave\n\nSeven rows of the same word in Roboto Flex (bundled, OFL). style/font-variations sets each row’s weight (wght) and width (wdth) from sin(time − row · 0.55), so a wave of weight rolls down the stack. The engine shapes every row at its axis values, so letters reflow as they swell.",
        "width": 460,
        "height": 230
      }
    },
